{"id":"memorial_101804","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101800","label":"Data · Climate Change Report"},"label":"September 3, XX.","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101803","next":"memorial_101805","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101804_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"Factories across the world have been shut down."},{"id":"memorial_101804_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"Half of the earth has been occupied by the aliens."},{"id":"memorial_101804_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"However, on the land which they have conquered,"},{"id":"memorial_101804_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"they live in peaceful communities, like the indigenous people of old."},{"id":"memorial_101804_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"There are no humans,"},{"id":"memorial_101804_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"but no environmental pollution either."},{"id":"memorial_101804_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_18_04_description","text":"I am unsure whether these places should be considered paradise or hell."}]}